OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: Media now loads complete SD and internal libraries, retries Nano's briefly empty response and keeps capacity visible during playback. Also adds clearer controls, experimental Multiview, LEVEL, Double-tap Level and Osmo Action 6 support. Fixes Live View crashes, dropped-packet freezes, Nano zoom and clip deletion, with lower CPU use. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
